上一个补丁只挡住我方先关：sentClose 只对 .closedLocally / .closed 为 true。对端先发
CHANNEL_CLOSE（网络抖动、远端掉线）时状态是 .closedRemotely，sentClose 为 false，
isActiveOnChannel 为 true，sendChannelWindowAdjust 照样 preconditionFailure，
同一个崩溃从这扇门进来。

ChildChannelStateMachine 新增 canSendWindowAdjust，只对 sendChannelWindowAdjust
接受的 4 个状态（.active / .halfClosedLocal / .halfClosedRemote / .quiescent）返回
true；deliverSingleRead 改用它判断。apple/swift-nio-ssh 的 main 仍只有 sentClose
守卫，这个补丁可以提给上游。
---
 .../ChildChannelStateMachine.swift            | 17 +++++++++++++++++
 .../Child Channels/SSHChildChannel.swift      | 19 ++++++++++++-------
 2 files changed, 29 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Sources/NIOSSH/Child Channels/ChildChannelStateMachine.swift b/Sources/NIOSSH/Child Channels/ChildChannelStateMachine.swift
index 732ae17..2c3c292 100644
--- a/Sources/NIOSSH/Child Channels/ChildChannelStateMachine.swift	
+++ b/Sources/NIOSSH/Child Channels/ChildChannelStateMachine.swift	
@@ -609,6 +609,23 @@ extension ChildChannelStateMachine {
         }
     }
 
+    // uTerm patch #2: whether sending a CHANNEL_WINDOW_ADJUST is legal in the
+    // current state. This is the EXACT accepting set of `sendChannelWindowAdjust`
+    // and is strictly narrower than `isActiveOnChannel`, which also returns true
+    // for `.closedLocally` and `.closedRemotely` — states in which a window adjust
+    // hits a `preconditionFailure` and aborts the process. `sentClose` (patch #1)
+    // only excluded `.closedLocally`/`.closed`; `.closedRemotely` (peer sent
+    // CHANNEL_CLOSE first — the network-flap case) still leaked through. Gating on
+    // this predicate closes that gap and keeps the legality set in one place.
+    var canSendWindowAdjust: Bool {
+        switch self.state {
+        case .active, .halfClosedLocal, .halfClosedRemote, .quiescent:
+            return true
+        case .idle, .requestedLocally, .requestedRemotely, .closedLocally, .closedRemotely, .closed:
+            return false
+        }
+    }
+
     /// The local identifier for this channel. We always know this identifier.
     var localChannelIdentifier: UInt32 {
         switch self.state {
diff --git a/Sources/NIOSSH/Child Channels/SSHChildChannel.swift b/Sources/NIOSSH/Child Channels/SSHChildChannel.swift
index c9c62a3..df4161c 100644
--- a/Sources/NIOSSH/Child Channels/SSHChildChannel.swift	
+++ b/Sources/NIOSSH/Child Channels/SSHChildChannel.swift	
@@ -649,13 +649,18 @@ private extension SSHChildChannel {
     private func deliverSingleRead(_ data: PendingContent) {
         switch data {
         case .data(let data):
-            // We only futz with the window manager if the channel is not already closed.
-            // uTerm patch: also skip when we've sent CHANNEL_CLOSE (state .closedLocally/.closed).
-            // Draining buffered reads while in a closed-locally state would otherwise emit a
-            // CHANNEL_WINDOW_ADJUST, which the state machine rejects with a preconditionFailure
-            // ("Sent channel window adjust on channel in invalid state") and crashes the process.
-            // This mirrors the `!self.state.sentClose` guard added in upstream apple/swift-nio-ssh.
-            if !self.didClose, !self.state.sentClose, let increment = self.windowManager.unbufferBytes(data.data.readableBytes) {
+            // We only futz with the window manager if the channel is still in a state that
+            // accepts a CHANNEL_WINDOW_ADJUST. Draining buffered reads while the channel is
+            // closing would otherwise emit a window adjust, which the state machine rejects with
+            // a preconditionFailure ("Sent channel window adjust on channel in invalid state")
+            // and crashes the whole process on the EventLoop thread.
+            //
+            // uTerm patch #1 used `!self.state.sentClose`, which only excluded the WE-closed
+            // direction (.closedLocally/.closed). The peer-closed-first direction (.closedRemotely
+            // — the network-flap case) still passed the guard and crashed. uTerm patch #2 gates on
+            // `canSendWindowAdjust`, the exact accepting set of `sendChannelWindowAdjust`, covering
+            // both directions. See vendor/swift-nio-ssh/UTERM-PATCHES.md.
+            if !self.didClose, self.state.canSendWindowAdjust, let increment = self.windowManager.unbufferBytes(data.data.readableBytes) {
                 let update = SSHMessage.ChannelWindowAdjustMessage(recipientChannel: self.state.remoteChannelIdentifier!, bytesToAdd: UInt32(increment))
                 self.processOutboundMessage(.channelWindowAdjust(update), promise: nil)
             }
